        "Description": "Good Morning 47,\rSeems its time for some Monday morning quarterbacking. A rich family wants to down size its staff and lets just say they rather pay our severance package than these peoples. You know the old saying &quot;Its just the cost of doing business&quot; well this business cost these people their lives. Not just their livelyhood. Ironic, Its like rain on your wedding day. But its actually a funeral. \rIll leave you to wish your condolences.",
